# Architecture

- Put vertical slices in `src/features/<name>/`.
- Keep pages and `App` thin; UI components consume feature hooks.
- Keep network access in `src/features/<name>/api/` and read API configuration
  from `import.meta.env`, never from hard-coded production URLs.
- Keep domain types beside their feature and avoid feature-to-feature imports.
- Register the service worker only in `src/main.tsx`.
- Treat offline behavior as a product contract: cache application-shell assets,
  but do not cache authenticated API responses unless explicitly designed.
- Use semantic HTML and test user-visible behavior.
